{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>ViuTV節目《港出好味道》最新一集來到荷蘭Zwolle，主持Ivy與Kit跟隨移居當地的餐廳老闆Terrence體驗狂歡節慶。節目中眾人不僅品嚐地道冠軍薯條與小食，Terrence更在鏡頭前示範一道打破傳統常規的港式叉燒。這款加入特殊秘方的招牌菜不僅震撼主持味蕾，更在網上掀起熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>Ivy與Kit現身Zwolle街頭狂歡並品嚐地道冠軍薯條</h2>\n<p>節目中Ivy與Kit跟隨Terrence穿梭荷蘭Zwolle市中心，感受當地人享受陽光與節慶熱鬧氣氛。三人特意前往當地一間榮獲報章評選冠軍殊榮小食店，品嚐新鮮即炸香脆薯條與特製炸肉卷。面對外脆內軟兼帶有洋蔥咖喱香氣地道美食，主持們食到停不了口。Ivy品嚐香脆蜜糖餅時更直指餅乾外層十分爽脆，並將整塊蜜糖餅迅速吃完。</p>\n<h2>老闆Terrence親爆改良叉燒秘訣</h2>\n<p>狂歡過後眾人返回中餐廳廚房，Terrence親自向主持展示其首創港式招牌菜。他向鏡頭解釋這道菜式做法與香港大同小異，但會在最後加上蜜糖與檸檬汁走油，並強調「檸檬汁配嗰個蜜糖呢，係冇得頂」。Ivy試食後大讚肉質鬆化且完全沒有羶味，直言這款特製蜜糖檸檬汁令整碟叉燒「回魂」。Terrence表示為了適應荷蘭人口味與餐廳出菜速度，這款叉燒經過多次測試與改良才正式出爐。</p>\n<h2>兩代人共同經營荷蘭中餐館展現出極致餐飲專業</h2>\n<p>這間中餐館原本由Terrence父親創立，目前廚房仍由工作超過30年叔叔及姑丈坐鎮。Terrence接手後決定推行革新，不僅打破傳統引入餐酒搭配觀念，更親自從香港及中國內地試食取經。他透露每次尋找新靈感後都會與長輩商量，坦言「如果繼續想有個future啦，中餐呢一定要改翻革新潮流」。目前餐廳在當地華人與荷蘭人圈子中均累積了大批長期捧場客。</p>\n<h2>創新港式菜餚 大量觀眾與網民熱議</h2>\n<p>節目播出後隨即在各大網上討論區引發極大迴響，不少觀眾對這款檸檬蜜糖叉燒表示高度關注。有網民留言表示「估唔到荷蘭都有咁正宗又創新港式美食」，亦有人讚賞Terrence在傳承與創新之間取得完美平衡。部分心水清網民更指出廚房內兩代人合作無間非常難得，紛紛留言指出「一家人齊心合力搞好間餐廳好感動」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472032138925855_15747814556af942424539c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Ivy與老闆Terrence親身落場協助餐館招呼客人。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472032138925855_15747814556af942424539c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy與老闆Terrence親身落場協助餐館招呼客人。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794720328470424_16908900566af9424924926.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Terrence示範製作港式叉燒，並巧妙加入檸檬汁與蜜糖調味，令肉質更添層次與回味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794720328470424_16908900566af9424924926.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Terrence示範製作港式叉燒，並巧妙加入檸檬汁與蜜糖調味，令肉質更添層次與回味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-15-3.06.15_8297841776af95a52d2a0e-1024x576.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Kit和Ivy試食Terrence店首創的破格叉燒，大呼好味道。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/-2026-11-15-3.06.15_8297841776af95a52d2a0e-1024x576.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Kit和Ivy試食Terrence店首創的破格叉燒，大呼好味道。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472036444869141_19743749746af9426cdc17c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Ivy興奮地品嚐著豐富的雪糕，大讚牛油果及果香濃郁，質感綿滑、非常美味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472036444869141_19743749746af9426cdc17c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy興奮地品嚐著豐富的雪糕，大讚牛油果及果香濃郁，質感綿滑、非常美味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17947203701726211_20998649226af94272c4492.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Ivy試食地道蜜糖餅，十分滋味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17947203701726211_20998649226af94272c4492.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy試食地道蜜糖餅，十分滋味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472037691493429_12579866756af942796f57f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv 適逢荷蘭國王生日，Kit、Ivy與Terrence表弟一同在街頭參與慶祝並品嚐特色甜餅與小食。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472037691493429_12579866756af942796f57f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>適逢荷蘭國王生日，Kit、Ivy與Terrence表弟一同在街頭參與慶祝並品嚐特色甜餅與小食。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472038539986859_7419553586af942820b172.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Ivy品嚐當地特式越南春卷。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472038539986859_7419553586af942820b172.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy品嚐當地特式越南春卷。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472033604492755_1129157346af94250ed150.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Terrence帶Ivy和Kit造訪Zwolle大城市，在當地著名的Snackbar品嚐獲得榮譽的冠軍新鮮薯條。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472033604492755_1129157346af94250ed150.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Terrence帶Ivy和Kit造訪Zwolle大城市，在當地著名的Snackbar品嚐獲得榮譽的冠軍新鮮薯條。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472034336889299_7299280176af94257da9f3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Ivy很欣賞荷蘭的風土人情與悠閒生活。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472034336889299_7299280176af94257da9f3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy很欣賞荷蘭的風土人情與悠閒生活。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472035001822314_9942672896af9425eae9b1.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Terrence帶Ivy和Kit到處觀光，並分享在當地的生活。他成功結合本地人的飲食喜好與香港美食精髓，讓荷蘭人與華人都喜愛他充滿人情味的港式餐館。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472035001822314_9942672896af9425eae9b1.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Terrence帶Ivy和Kit到處觀光，並分享在當地的生活。他成功結合本地人的飲食喜好與香港美食精髓，讓荷蘭人與華人都喜愛他充滿人情味的港式餐館。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472035667086712_6090263076af9426521248.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 viutv Terrence的表弟啟賢、Ivy和Kit在荷蘭的雪糕店挑戰極限，豪邁地購買了十球不同口味的雪糕。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472035667086712_6090263076af9426521248.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Terrence的表弟啟賢、Ivy和Kit在荷蘭的雪糕店挑戰極限，豪邁地購買了十球不同口味的雪糕。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T07:37:08.528514+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1658,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T05:26:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T07:51:17.894789+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T07:31:04.015321+00:00","content_hash":"cce07597f7fc63032c5692d0c97b25b16114356402fda896699f6aeeb4667365","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}